#### Podolanski-Armenteros cut

The Podolanski-Armenteros plot for \(K_{S}^{0}\), \(\Lambda\) and \(\bar{\Lambda}\) is shown in Fig. 5.11. The \(K_{S}^{0}\) candidates are constructed with V0s that satisfy the following cuts:

